{
  "slug": "rootly",
  "name": "Rootly",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Full-lifecycle incident management: deploy safety, incident response, on-call management, and retrospectives.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **18 skills**, **3 agents**, **2 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (18): `action` (Manage incident action items from the terminal), `alert` (Triage a Rootly alert by short ID), `announce` (Draft a stakeholder-facing status update for an active incident, then post it after explicit confirmation), `ask` (Ask natural language questions about incidents, on-call, services, and reliability data), `brief` (Generate a concise stakeholder brief for an incident), `cover` (Offer to cover someone else's on-call shift), `deploy-check` ([experimental] Evaluate deployment risk by analyzing code changes against incident history, active incidents, and on-call readiness), `handoff` (Prepare an incident or on-call handoff document), and 10 more\n- **Agents** (3): `deploy-guardian` (Deployment safety specialist for blast-radius analysis, downstream dependency checks, and cross-team coordination planning), `incident-investigator` (Deep production-incident investigator for root-cause analysis, evidence gathering, and remediation planning beyond the initial response brief), `retro-analyst` (Reliability pattern analyst for retrospectives, recurring-incident clustering, and systemic improvement recommendations)\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `PreToolUse`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `rootly`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install rootly@claude-plugins-official` from `Rootly-AI-Labs/rootly-claude-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 18,
    "agent": 3,
    "hook": 2,
    "mcp": 1
  },
